# areas | doc="The areas a project's configuration and data are split into. Each area can be switched on and off: an area that is off is hidden completely — its items vanish from every read, writes to them are refused, and its automation pauses. scope=project areas are switched per project; scope=workspace ones for the whole install. card_types are the item types whose data belongs to the area (a card is hidden when it, or a card above it, has one of them). depends_on lists areas that must be on. starts are the feature bundles (the other files here) an area can start from, the first being the default."

